Z||000033||chris6878||08-25-99||01:12 PM||||Hey Guys..<p>You guys mention how rare the fiero is....<br>I own a 84 model, red with gray interior and getting ready to buy an 85 gt 6cyl. There are a few fiero's in my area. I live in WV.<p>I know of about 6 84 models  local within 20 miles. They are all "parked" with problems.<p>One of my friends have another 84 model like mine.. its black... still runs like mine too..<p>There is also an 87 SE running around here to. And i found two 85 GT's withing a mile of my house. Both parked. One of whick i am buying that has a knock in the motor that i am planning to repair. <p>There are a few here compared to what you guys have posted ..  at least 5 locally that run and 10 or 15 that are Parked...These cars are getting rare.... the ones that run are even more rare..<p>Later guys...<br>chris.
