Z||000042||Silver Bullet||08-28-99||11:12 PM||||I live near Gettsburg PA, and I am really starting to believe that I see a different Fiero every day.  What surprises me (no offense to anybody) is that there are alot of older people driving them.  I thought it was sort of a teenager thing.  It's actually pretty reassurring to know that you don't lose the love for a fine car with age!!!
